# This service starts the CiA402 homing of one or more drives: the controlword is
# pulsed to 0x1F ("Enable operation" pattern + bit 4 = start homing) for one control
# cycle, in whatever state and mode the drive currently is, then restored. Suited to
# instantaneous homing methods only (e.g. homing at the current position): per CiA402
# the bit-4 falling edge after the pulse interrupts motion-based homing. The drive
# must be commissioned accordingly.

# DoF names to home. Empty = every configured drive.
string[] dof_names
---
# Return message
string return_message
